VALUES (4, 'True or False: Modern P2P networks no longer require specialized software beyond the operating system to function.', 'A. False', 'B. True', 'C. Only in corporate settings', 'D. Only for small networks', 'A', 'Specialized software is necessary for coordination and resource sharing in modern P2P networks.', 'hard');
VALUES (4, 'Interpretation: 
