VALUES (4, 'MCQ: What role does a Network Operating System (NOS) play in resource sharing?', 'A. It manages shared applications, data, and devices among clients', 'B. It only controls local disk storage', 'C. It provides antivirus protection', 'D. It increases internet bandwidth', 'A', 'NOS is responsible for managing shared network resources and applications.', 'medium');
