VALUES (4, 'MCQ: What differentiates a Network Operating System (NOS) from a personal operating system?', 'A. NOS manages network resources and user permissions', 'B. NOS only runs games', 'C. NOS is used for personal productivity software', 'D. NOS requires no user input', 'A', 'NOS specializes in managing multiple users and resources in a network environment.', 'medium');
