VALUES (4, 'Short: List two advantages of client/server networks over peer-to-peer networks.', 'A. Centralized management and improved security', 'B. Easier to set up and less expensive', 'C. Requires no servers and no specialized software', 'D. All clients have equal authority', 'A', 'Client/server networks allow centralized control and better security management.', 'hard');
