VALUES (4, 'How do commercial device servers enhance legacy equipment?', 'A. By requiring a full network rewrite', 'B. By enabling software-only upgrades', 'C. By network-enabling existing devices without special software', 'D. By limiting compatibility with POS systems', 'C', 'Commercial device servers make it easy to connect old devices like POS terminals to networks cost-effectively.', 'medium');
VALUES (4, 'Fill in the blank: Industrial device servers are designed for ________ environments and support ________ protocols.', 'A. office; HTTP', 'B. factory; Modbus', 'C. residential; FTP', 'D. school; TCP', 'B', 'Industrial servers are tailored for harsh factory environments and support industrial protocols like Modbus.', 'medium');
VALUES (4, 'Which of the following best describes the purpose of embedded device servers?', 'A. To reduce device security', 'B. To handle manual data entry', 'C. To web-enable or network-enable a product quickly', 'D. To replace the operating system of a device', 'C', 'They integrate the required hardware and software to easily connect devices to the network.', 'medium');
