VALUES (4, 'Why are embedded device servers considered plug-and-play?', 'A. They do not need an OS', 'B. They integrate all needed components and function autonomously', 'C. They only work with Microsoft systems', 'D. They use proprietary connections', 'B', 'Embedded device servers include OS, networking stack, and connectivity, allowing quick deployment.', 'medium');
