VALUES (4, 'Which of the following best describes Lantronix''s approach to embedded networking?', 'A. Complex, firmware-heavy integrations', 'B. Lightweight, manual configuration of every unit', 'C. Cost-effective, quick-to-implement embedded networking', 'D. Emphasis on replacing existing circuits with analog ones', 'C', 'Lantronix focuses on providing efficient, reliable, and scalable networking solutions for electronic products.', 'medium');
