VALUES (4, 'Short: Why are Lantronix embedded solutions considered useful for OEMs?', 'A. They are used for wireless phone charging', 'B. They reduce cost and development time by offering ready-to-integrate network modules', 'C. They eliminate the need for any hardware', 'D. They are used only for mobile apps', 'B', 'Lantronix offers off-the-shelf embedded servers that save time and reduce the need for OEMs to develop complex networking solutions themselves.', 'medium');
VALUES (4, 'What is the primary function of a terminal server in a network?', 'A. To encrypt data between client and server', 'B. To provide terminals access to hosts over LANs without direct connections', 'C. To convert analog signals to digital signals', 'D. To increase wireless coverage in a network', 'B', 'Terminal servers allow multiple terminals to communicate with hosts without requiring dedicated lines for each terminal, making it cost-effective and efficient.', 'medium');
VALUES (4, 'True or False: Terminal servers support only a single communication session between terminal and host.', 'A. True', 'B. False', '', '', 'B', 'Terminal servers support multiple concurrent sessions, allowing a single terminal to connect to several hosts at once.', 'medium');
