VALUES (4, 'What capability allows terminal servers to move data between devices connected via serial ports on different servers?', 'A. SNMP management', 'B. Opening connections between serial ports', 'C. Wireless relay', 'D. File sharing protocol', 'B', 'Terminal servers can open serial port connections between devices, enabling them to communicate across the network.', 'medium');
