VALUES (4, 'Fill in the blank: ________ protocols monitor packet traffic and detect packet loss, unlike traditional serial technologies.', 'A. USB', 'B. Bluetooth', 'C. Ethernet', 'D. RS-232', 'C', 'Ethernet protocols include mechanisms to detect and handle packet loss, which serial protocols like RS-232 do not.', 'medium');
VALUES (4, 'Which of the following applications is NOT typically associated with device servers?', 'A. Data Acquisition', 'B. Industrial Automation', 'C. Game Design', 'D. Security Systems', 'C', 'Device servers are used in technical and industrial contexts such as data acquisition and security systems, not in game design.', 'medium');
VALUES (4, 'Why might an organization choose Ethernet over RS-232 for data acquisition purposes?', 'A. Lower hardware costs', 'B. Better wireless support', 'C. Longer transmission distance and better data integrity', 'D. Easier coding', 'C', 'Ethernet provides longer range and built-in mechanisms for data validation, making it superior to RS-232 for reliable communication.', 'medium');
VALUES (4, 'Interpretation: An industrial setting uses RS-485 for linking sensors but occasionally loses data. What would improve data integrity?', 'A. Switch to RS-232', 'B. Switch to Ethernet with packet monitoring', 'C. Use Bluetooth', 'D. Add more sensors', 'B', 'Ethernet protocols include packet monitoring, which helps detect and recover lost data, improving data integrity over RS-485.', 'medium');
